Package: querencia-dokumente
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Querencia Desktop document viewer (alpha)
 Querencia Dokumente is the PDF viewer of Querencia Desktop, a classic
 desktop in the style of GNOME 2, modelled on Evince 2.30: page view
 with zoom and fit modes, thumbnails and outline in the side pane, search,
 printing and document properties.
 .
 PDF files are read with the poppler library (libpoppler-glib); the
 program as a whole is distributed under the GPL. The interface is
 English with a German translation (gettext).
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
